00:06:03.125 --> 00:06:06.405
So the agenda item number three is our

00:06:07.205 --> 00:06:16.070
main focus for tonight and for the next several meetings is the budget workshop for the fiscal year twenty twenty two-twenty twenty three proposed town budget.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.990
Eric, you put together a budget summary which you're going to be presenting.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:21.190
Correct.

